      sTabP.cost s0 ≤ tabCost (2 * HvdH.sWidth p α + 1) t (sWCost p Bq) := by
  have hw := sWP_wspec s0 p s t (HvdH.sWidth p α) (α ^ 2 * t ^ 2) (2 * HvdH.sWidth p α + 1) Bq
    (HvdH.betaT p α) LP LS LT LM LB LK ht rfl hP hS hT hM hB hK hBq hpB hKB hbB hwB hEB
  have H := tabP_all tdist_S hw LR LT hR hT
